    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "im looking at my portfolio and i'm heavily weighted in traditional energy/fossil fuels. given where global climate policy is headed, do you think the shift to renewables is pretty much an inevitability at this point, or is there still significant economic risk in assuming the transition will happen as fast as people say?",
